{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-005", "score": 0.116, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-005 | Study family SF-APPA-005: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)\n- observed_research_question: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Playoff defenses change scheme within games and between games, especially after the opponent ran a play type heavily.\n- observed_result: Within-game change 319/523 (61.0%); cross-game change 298/440 (67.7%); 103/104 units (99.0%) and 52/52 series show a change; transition matrices near-uniform.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- observed_failure_evidence: Doc caveat: inferred label cannot separate real defensive adjustment from offense executing differently; near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 523 cells; 440 pairs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-015", "score": 0.108, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-015 | Study family SF-APPS-015: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- observed_research_question: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams and players differ in how often H2 trigger possessions land on the engine's BEST vs AVOID counter.\n- observed_result: Team AVOID% ranges 50.6% (ORL) to 6.8% (SAC); team BEST% 0.0%-15.8%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: No outcome test; player samples 10-178 possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: min 10 poss per player\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-048\n- observed_method: trigger_table_clean.csv, 55 series 2022-2026, 179 players, 25 teams, min 10 poss.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-001"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-036", "score": 0.099, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-036 | Study family SF-APPS-036: Player-level BEST vs AVOID PPP gap (initiators, 55-series)\n- observed_research_question: Player-level BEST vs AVOID PPP gap (initiators, 55-series)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: The team-level BEST vs AVOID gap holds when H2 possessions are filtered to initiating player.\n- observed_result: Mean gap (n>=10 each tier) +0.427 PPP. Mean BEST 1.347 (38 players) vs AVOID 0.920 (94 players). Stars mean gap +0.542 (n=15) vs role +0.428 (n=16). Only 3 players clear n>=30 both tiers (all BOS: White +0.864, Brown +0. [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Pooled player gap +0.427 in the same direction as the team gap; most star cells are below the n>=30 gate.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 38/94 players at n>=15; only 3 at n>=30 both tiers\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-016", "score": 0.098, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-016 | Study family SF-PAP-016: Portability feasibility gate\n- observed_research_question: Portability feasibility gate\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Enough movers with decoys exist and displacement signature is not collinear with play-type profile.\n- observed_result: Prereg: 296 movers, decoy frac 1.00, vacuity rho=0.048; final output: 294 movers, rho=0.007\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: gate passed\n- observed_sample_and_power: 296/294 movers\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF19\n- observed_method: Mover signature cache; G1 >=25 movers, G2 >=80% with >=3 decoys, G3 |rho|<0.90.\n- observed_verdict: supported\n- observed_failure_type: D_positive\n- observed_notes: Mover count and vacuity rho changed between prereg record and final output.\n- auto_confidence: high (1.0)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-051\n- auto_uses_method: METH:correlation"}], "n_results": 4}

